        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve organized the game content and Q&amp;A to help players quickly figure out if it’s right for them! No need to waste everyone’s time!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The English part of the fourth level has not yet been translated)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Composition</strong>: 70% stationary shooting &quot;horde-slaying&quot; + 30% absurd humor (The content contains a touch of &quot;hell jokes&quot; (i.e., dark humor with morbid or taboo undertones).).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong>: A single round lasts about 5–20 minutes. Current total gameplay duration is approximately 2–3 hours (the game is not yet complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM</strong>: Mostly phonk-style music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style</strong>: As shown in the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Performance Requirements</strong>: None! If your computer can run 4399 games, it’ll basically run this without lag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Roguelike Elements</strong>: Low replay value, as it’s a linear level-based game.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve organized the game content and Q&amp;A to help players quickly figure out if it’s right for them! No need to waste everyone’s time!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The English part of the fourth level has not yet been translated)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Composition</strong>: 70% stationary shooting &quot;horde-slaying&quot; + 30% absurd humor (The content contains a touch of &quot;hell jokes&quot; (i.e., dark humor with morbid or taboo undertones).).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow</strong>: A single round lasts about 5–20 minutes. Current total gameplay duration is approximately 2–3 hours (the game is not yet complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM</strong>: Mostly phonk-style music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Style</strong>: As shown in the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC Performance Requirements</strong>: None! If your computer can run 4399 games, it’ll basically run this without lag.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Roguelike Elements</strong>: Low replay value, as it’s a linear level-based game.</p></li></ul>",
